  "[action] eldest son visits father",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung and eldest son sit and smoke tobacco.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"It is a good day and I wish to sit in the sun and smoke a pipe and watch the fields. It is a good day to be alive and I would not be in that cold, dark room if I were you.\"",
