  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung looks at eldest son",
  "[action] eldest son eats",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) Eldest son invites father to eat",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"What sort of meat is that?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Is it a sheep?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"I would not have thought you were hungry enough to eat a sheep, or that the house could afford it.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"It was a lamb and I bought it for a little piece of silver and it was cheap. My wife said we might as well eat it.\"",
